#reason src/renderer/lantern-guide.css Gives the Guide view its quiet look from existing theme variables.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternguide.ts Keeps the switch rules and the choice of rows a step owns apart from the DOM.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternguideview.ts Draws the guide as a short tour with its own state for the session.
#reason test/e2e/pr-review-guide.spec.ts Proves the guide opens, steps, folds, toggles and hands back to Files.
#reason test/lantern-guide-view.test.ts Pins row selection, the switch rules and the view behaviour without a browser.
#reason package.json Lists the new guide spec in the pull request review e2e script.
#reason scripts/esbuild.mjs Copies the new Guide stylesheet into the build.
#reason scripts/pr-review-demo.mjs Opens the demo on its guide so the tour can be looked at by hand.
#reason src/renderer/lantern.css Lets the Guide reuse the review diff colours instead of copying them.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternmacroview.ts Adds the Guide button to the view strip next to Files, Macro and Flow.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternview.ts Hosts the Guide like Flow and opens on it when the record has one.
#reason src/renderer/workspace.html Loads the Guide stylesheet in the app.
#reason test/e2e/app/index.html Loads the Guide stylesheet in the harness.
#reason test/e2e/app/main.cjs Passes the guide switch from the environment to the harness page.
#reason test/e2e/app/renderer.ts Attaches the demo guide only on request so other specs keep opening in Files.
#reason test/fixtures/graph/pr-review-demo.ts Gives the demo pull request a realistic five-step guide.
#story A reviewer reads a pull request as a guided tour
#step actor Reviewer
#step action opens
#step subject a pull request that has a guide
